WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:09.820
[elevator music]

00:00:09.820 --> 00:00:11.820
[elevator music gives way to dramatic music]

00:00:14.000 --> 00:00:16.200
No... God, no!

00:00:16.200 --> 00:00:20.620
[dramatic music]

00:00:21.140 --> 00:00:24.640
Please, not Malcolm!
No, not another one!

00:00:24.640 --> 00:00:28.400
[dramatic music]

00:00:28.800 --> 00:00:31.240
Is it another challenge that you want, Malcolm?

00:00:31.240 --> 00:00:33.500
Then I am ready. But wait...

00:00:33.560 --> 00:00:38.400
I gotta put on my hater blockers.
[laughs sarcastically]

00:00:39.520 --> 00:00:40.820
I actually can't see anything.

00:00:40.820 --> 00:00:43.060
[dramatic music continues]
[Felix]: You think you can make me laugh?

00:00:43.060 --> 00:00:44.780
Nothing makes me laugh.

00:00:44.780 --> 00:00:48.280
[dramatic music]

00:00:49.640 --> 00:00:50.620
[music ends abruptly]
[Felix, distorted]: Let's begin.

00:00:50.940 --> 00:00:53.900
[reading from screen]: "You're visiting Pewdiepie on OkCupid."

00:00:53.900 --> 00:00:56.460
That's, like, a dating site.
I know that.

00:00:56.460 --> 00:00:59.360
I did not make that profile!
[reading from screen]: "My self-summary:"

00:00:59.360 --> 00:01:05.540
"...First and foremost I am a Sir. Always seem to find myself in the fr--" [snickers, then stops]

00:01:07.200 --> 00:01:08.180
"...in the friendzone."

00:01:08.180 --> 00:01:12.560
"...I'm a really nice guy that would rather spend a night cuddling than having sex."

00:01:12.560 --> 00:01:17.420
"...I am a--" [snickers and whimpers]
"...I am a--I'm--" [chuckles, then stops abruptly]

00:01:18.180 --> 00:01:24.380
"...I am a proud atheist and attend many free-thinking rallies. Wake up, sheeple!"

00:01:24.380 --> 00:01:27.420
"The first thing people usually notice about me:"

00:01:27.420 --> 00:01:30.380
"...My fedora. I'm never seen without it. T--"

00:01:31.020 --> 00:01:34.600
"...'Tis--"
"...'Tis a part of me."

00:01:35.220 --> 00:01:37.160
"...I spend a lot of time thinking about:"

00:01:37.160 --> 00:01:43.620
"...How people can be so blind and follow organized religion and if I'll ever get out of the f--" [chuckles]

00:01:45.360 --> 00:01:47.060
"On a typical Friday night, I am:"

00:01:47.060 --> 00:01:49.460
"...Relaxing at home with a glass of brandy and my thoughts."

00:01:49.460 --> 00:01:51.540
"The most private thing I'm willing to admit:"

00:01:51.540 --> 00:01:53.880
"...I'm still a virgin and I watch anime."

00:01:56.300 --> 00:01:59.300
...That's not true.
Whatever, all right? Whatever.

00:01:59.300 --> 00:02:01.160
You think...you think you're funny?

00:02:01.160 --> 00:02:03.900
Didn't even laugh.
So far, I'm fine.

00:02:03.900 --> 00:02:07.180
Oh, you got a video next!
That's cute. I'll play it.

00:02:07.680 --> 00:02:21.120
[light music playing in the video]

00:02:21.120 --> 00:02:23.120
[music abruptly stops]

00:02:26.100 --> 00:02:28.220
[tensely] I'm fine!
[snickers, then stops abruptly, catching himself]

00:02:28.700 --> 00:02:29.820
That was not a laugh.

00:02:30.020 --> 00:02:35.420
So far, I'm beating you at your own game, bitch! Malcolm! [blows kiss]

00:02:35.720 --> 00:02:37.840
I bet you are a virgin and watch anime.

00:02:39.380 --> 00:02:42.700
You're probably 8, so it actually makes sense.
But whatever!

00:02:43.040 --> 00:02:45.800
Next one.
[reading from screen] "I have to be someone..."

00:02:45.800 --> 00:02:48.020
"...on the internet because I'm..."
[stops abruptly]

00:02:51.140 --> 00:02:54.120
No!
I'll have you know, I am very...

00:02:54.120 --> 00:02:56.360
...popular in real life as well.

00:02:57.560 --> 00:02:58.660
I have many friends.

00:02:58.960 --> 00:03:03.340
[sad music]
...Shut up.

00:03:03.640 --> 00:03:05.480
Oh, another video! That's cute.

00:03:05.480 --> 00:03:06.920
Here we go.

00:03:07.160 --> 00:03:16.360
[woman droning in video]

00:03:17.840 --> 00:03:19.500
[woman screams, is cut off abruptly when the video ends]

00:03:19.500 --> 00:03:21.500
[Felix chuckles]

00:03:25.420 --> 00:03:27.080
[Felix groans]

00:03:30.760 --> 00:03:32.780
Didn't laugh.

00:03:35.720 --> 00:03:37.280
What the fuck was that...?
[snickers lightly]

00:03:37.280 --> 00:03:39.320
[snickers louder and sucks breath in sharply]

00:03:39.500 --> 00:03:41.340
All right, next one!

00:03:41.520 --> 00:03:42.660
[reading from screen]
"Hey, PewDiePie!"

00:03:42.660 --> 00:03:43.960
"...Kill yourself, pls."

00:03:44.160 --> 00:03:45.960
"...PewDiePie found dead."

00:03:50.160 --> 00:03:53.720
This is offensive to dead people.
I'm gonna post this on Tumblr.

00:03:55.000 --> 00:03:56.660
[sighs] Fuck you.

00:03:57.340 --> 00:03:59.540
[Felix, voiceover]: "I saw this post on Tumblr,
and I just want to say..."

00:03:59.540 --> 00:04:04.660
"...this is extremely offensive, not only to me,
but to the people of the universe who has ever died."

00:04:04.660 --> 00:04:07.160
"...I feel triggered, hurt, and vulnerable."

00:04:07.340 --> 00:04:08.680
[distorted noise]

00:04:08.680 --> 00:04:09.520
Here we go.

00:04:09.760 --> 00:04:11.500
[music plays in video]
[Felix, reading]: "Samurai Cop."

00:04:11.500 --> 00:04:13.140
"...He speaks fluent Japanese."

00:04:13.140 --> 00:04:16.440
[man #1 in video]: They call him Samurai.
He speaks fluent Japanese.

00:04:16.720 --> 00:04:19.200
[man #2 in video]: Are you Fuj...Fujiama?

00:04:19.480 --> 00:04:22.600
[man #3 in video]: What does "katana" mean?
[man #2 in video]: It means "Japanese sword."

00:04:22.980 --> 00:04:25.680
[upbeat, musical sting]

00:04:25.680 --> 00:04:27.680
[Felix chuckles]

00:04:37.120 --> 00:04:38.920
[gags, then breathes deeply]

00:04:40.220 --> 00:04:42.340
[deadpan] Hilarious.
Moving on!

00:04:43.260 --> 00:04:45.080
[reading from screen] "Oh yeah, baby!
Tell me what you want!"

00:04:45.080 --> 00:04:47.080
"...Talk to me like you're a fucking idiot!"

00:04:47.080 --> 00:04:50.820
"...PewDiePie is the best YouTube channel."
"That's perfect!"

00:04:52.420 --> 00:04:55.420
Hey, I mean, whatever gets her off, am I right?
Pound it.

00:04:56.060 --> 00:04:58.660
[upbeat, musical sting]

00:04:59.200 --> 00:05:01.520
Oh, another video.
Fine.

00:05:01.900 --> 00:05:04.600
The videos are the hardest, man.
I can't fuckin' do the videos.

00:05:04.940 --> 00:05:08.220
[long silence]

00:05:08.220 --> 00:05:10.680
[man screams, bells ring in video]

00:05:17.820 --> 00:05:19.520
[snickers]

00:05:20.760 --> 00:05:22.880
[snickers louder]

00:05:23.060 --> 00:05:26.200
[reading screen] "Let's watch a
Pewdiepie video starter pack."

00:05:26.620 --> 00:05:29.820
Okay, cool shirt - hey, I got one of those!

00:05:29.900 --> 00:05:32.780
Cool sunglasses. I got 'em!

00:05:33.140 --> 00:05:35.020
[reads screen] "Autism..."
[background music abruptly stops]

00:05:36.940 --> 00:05:37.920
...I got it!
[background music resumes]

00:05:38.220 --> 00:05:40.820
Grape juice. My favorite!

00:05:42.080 --> 00:05:44.180
[somber musical sting]

00:05:44.180 --> 00:05:46.400
[reads screen] "How to watch a PewDiePie video:"

00:05:46.400 --> 00:05:49.620
"...Method 1 out of 3. Commit suicide..."
[music abruptly stops]

00:05:54.320 --> 00:05:59.800
Oh, yeah? So you're telling me that
43 million people kill themselves?

00:05:59.880 --> 00:06:01.520
That doesn't even make any sense!

00:06:01.520 --> 00:06:03.380
[voice echoes as sinister music plays]
That's the dumbest thing I've ever heard.

00:06:03.380 --> 00:06:05.320
Man, this is too easy, come on.
[reads screen] Turkish man...

00:06:05.320 --> 00:06:06.840
[man in video] MEOW!

00:06:12.620 --> 00:06:14.620
[man in video] MEOW!

00:06:14.620 --> 00:06:16.640
...And people call my videos retarded.

00:06:16.720 --> 00:06:17.940
We did it!

00:06:19.960 --> 00:06:22.600
[hiccups and reads screen]
"And don't forget that PewDiePie sucks."

00:06:23.020 --> 00:06:27.240
"...Only in it for the money.
We've done good infiltrating his system."

00:06:27.240 --> 00:06:30.140
"Now we move on to phase 2..."

00:06:30.440 --> 00:06:33.800
[dramatic music]
Wait, what? Phase 2?

00:06:33.800 --> 00:06:35.360
[static]

00:06:35.360 --> 00:06:37.980
[computerized voice]: Now my sleeper agents,
it's time to be activated.

00:06:37.980 --> 00:06:41.620
Initiate Phase 2.
Code word: SEPTIC4LYF

00:06:41.620 --> 00:06:44.860
The war has only just begun.
Don't call me fat,

00:06:44.860 --> 00:06:46.860
...because you're fat, too.

00:06:46.860 --> 00:06:48.860
[music fades]
[static]

00:06:49.580 --> 00:06:52.520
That was another great video!
Leave a like if you enjoyed.

00:06:52.520 --> 00:06:54.260
Subscribe to become a Bro today!

00:06:54.260 --> 00:06:56.680
Watch the other part of "Try Not to Laugh Challenge"!

00:06:56.680 --> 00:07:00.640
Let me know if you did it or not.
Did you complete the challenge? Be honest!

00:07:00.640 --> 00:07:03.660
And as always... [kisses fist]
...Thank you Bros so much for watching my videos.

00:07:03.660 --> 00:07:05.620
I really appreciate it!
Stay awesome, Bros!

00:07:06.320 --> 00:07:18.720
[outro music in the background as previous video plays]

00:07:18.720 --> 00:07:22.940
[outro music]

